"""The tools worker-build runs after rustc, pinned by checksum.

bazel/wasm/worker.bzl runs them as crates/clax-worker/build.sh's worker-build
0.8.7 does (worker-build's src/versions.rs): wasm-bindgen at the version the
Worker's wasm-bindgen crate is in Cargo.lock (scripts/bazel-derive.py's
features check fails when they differ), binaryen's wasm-opt 132 and esbuild
0.28.2, each for the machine the build runs on; and the JavaScript shim
worker-build wraps the module in, from its crate.
"""

